# The address of the API in backend/, for example https://api.your-domain.com/api.
# Set REACT_APP_API_URL in the deployment's environment before building, there is no default here on purpose.
# During npm start, .env.development points it at the local backend instead.
# The event's name, media, links, Wi-Fi and menu come from the API, they are set in the admin Event Details page.
